  "series": {
    "id": 1,
    "slug": "ba-bo-ke-zuo-cheng-zi-ji-xi-huan-de-yang-zi",
    "title": "把博客做成自己喜欢的样子",
    "order": 3
  },
  "pinned": false,
  "featured": true,
  "card_style": "auto",
  "published_at": "2026-10-20T12:34:51Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-10-24T12:34:51Z",
  "reading_minutes": 2,
  "word_count": 736,
  "html": "<p>先说结论：<strong>别用 <code>cp</code> 去备份一个正在被写入的 SQLite 数据库</strong>。我就是这样做的，而且还成功了很多次——直到有一次没成功。</p>\n<h2 id=\"事情是这样的\">事情是这样的</h2>\n<p>这个站用 SQLite 当数据库：一个文件，不用另外装服务，备份起来“应该很简单”。我的第一版备份脚本只有一行：</p>\n<div class=\"code\" data-lang=\"bash\"><div class=\"code__bar\"><span class=\"code__file\">backup.sh</span><button class=\"code__copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\"><span>复制</span></button></div><pre class=\"code-pre\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"c1\"># 每天凌晨三点跑一次</span>\ncp<span class=\"w\"> </span>/var/lib/blog/site.db<span class=\"w\"> </span>/var/backups/site-<span class=\"k\">$(</span>date<span class=\"w\"> </span>+%F<span class=\"k\">)</span>.db</code></pre></div>\n<p>看起来没毛病。直到某个周末我想试试恢复，发现最近一份备份<strong>打不开</strong>，提示 <code>database disk image is malformed</code>。</p>\n<div class=\"callout callout--warn\"><p class=\"callout__title\">当时的心情</p>\n<p>手心出汗，反复刷新，怀疑是不是自己手滑把库删了。（不是，我没有手滑，是我的备份有问题。）</p>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"为什么直接复制文件不安全\">为什么直接复制文件不安全</h2>\n<p>SQLite 的写入不是“一下子把文件改好”。复制的那一刻如果恰好有事务在写，你拿到的可能是写到一半的文件——页面对不上，自然打不开。</p>\n<h3 id=\"开了-wal-之后更要小心\">开了 WAL 之后更要小心</h3>\n<p>很多人（包括我）会打开 WAL 模式来提升并发。这时新写入的数据先进入 <code>site.db-wal</code>，要等“检查点”才会合并回主文件。只复制 <code>site.db</code>，就等于丢掉了还没合并的那部分。</p>\n<div class=\"callout callout--tip\"><p class=\"callout__title\">小提示</p>\n<p>主文件、<code>-wal</code>、<code>-shm</code> 是一个整体。要么用 SQLite 自己提供的备份接口，要么保证复制期间没有任何写入。</p>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"写法一sqlite3-命令行的-backup\">写法一：sqlite3 命令行的 .backup</h2>\n<p>最省事的做法，一行搞定，写入进行时也能得到一致的副本：</p>\n<div class=\"code\" data-lang=\"bash\"><div class=\"code__bar\"><span class=\"code__file\">backup.sh</span><button class=\"code__copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\"><span>复制</span></button></div><pre class=\"code-pre\"><code class=\"language-bash\">sqlite3<span class=\"w\"> </span>/var/lib/blog/site.db<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\".backup '/var/backups/site-</span><span class=\"k\">$(</span>date<span class=\"w\"> </span>+%F<span class=\"k\">)</span><span class=\"s2\">.db'\"</span></code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"写法二在-python-里调用-backup\">写法二：在 Python 里调用 backup()</h2>\n<p>应用本身是 Flask，我更想把备份写成一个函数，方便接到后台的“立即备份”按钮上。标准库里的 <code>sqlite3.Connection.backup</code> 正好够用：</p>\n<div class=\"code\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"code__bar\"><span class=\"code__file\">backup.py</span><button class=\"code__copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\"><span>复制</span></button></div><pre class=\"code-pre\"><code class=\"language-python\"><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sqlite3</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">backup</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">src_path</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">dst_path</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">src</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">sqlite3</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">connect</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">src_path</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">dst</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">sqlite3</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">connect</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dst_path</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">dst</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">src</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backup</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dst</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>   <span class=\"c1\"># 在线备份：写入进行时也能得到一致的副本</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">dst</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">close</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">src</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">close</span><span class=\"p\">()</span></code></pre></div>\n<figure class=\"fig polaroid\"><img src=\"/media/2c4c1728ca68ff0192cfe5437ac653d1/960.webp\" alt=\"凌晨的书桌，一台笔记本和一只杯子\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/media/2c4c1728ca68ff0192cfe5437ac653d1/480.webp 480w, /media/2c4c1728ca68ff0192cfe5437ac653d1/960.webp 960w, /media/2c4c1728ca68ff0192cfe5437ac653d1/1600.webp 1200w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 760px) 720px, 100vw\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" data-full=\"/media/2c4c1728ca68ff0192cfe5437ac653d1/1600.webp\" data-color=\"#e6f1fc\"><figcaption>写这段代码的那个凌晨</figcaption></figure>\n<h2 id=\"写法三vacuum-into\">写法三：VACUUM INTO</h2>\n<p>它会生成一个整理过的、体积更小的副本，还顺便做了碎片整理。需要 SQLite 3.27 以上：</p>\n<div class=\"code\" data-lang=\"sql\"><div class=\"code__bar\"><span class=\"code__file\">compact.sql</span><button class=\"code__copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\"><span>复制</span></button></div><pre class=\"code-pre\"><code class=\"language-sql\"><span class=\"k\">VACUUM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">INTO</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'/var/backups/site-compact.db'</span><span class=\"p\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"ta-left\">方法</th>\n<th class=\"ta-center\">要停写入吗</th>\n<th class=\"ta-left\">得到什么</th>\n<th class=\"ta-left\">适合</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ta-left\"><code>cp</code> 复制文件</td>\n<td class=\"ta-center\">要</td>\n<td class=\"ta-left\">原样文件（可能不完整）</td>\n<td class=\"ta-left\">停机维护时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ta-left\"><code>.backup</code></td>\n<td class=\"ta-center\">不用</td>\n<td class=\"ta-left\">一致的副本</td>\n<td class=\"ta-left\">定时任务、命令行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ta-left\"><code>backup()</code></td>\n<td class=\"ta-center\">不用</td>\n<td class=\"ta-left\">一致的副本</td>\n<td class=\"ta-left\">写进应用里</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ta-left\"><code>VACUUM INTO</code></td>\n<td class=\"ta-center\">不用</td>\n<td class=\"ta-left\">整理过的更小副本</td>\n<td class=\"ta-left\">想顺便瘦身</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<h2 id=\"恢复演练不试一次就不算备份\">恢复演练：不试一次就不算备份</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>备份文件只有被成功恢复过，才算备份。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>每次备份完成后，我会马上打开副本做两件事：检查完整性，数一数关键表里的行数。</p>\n<div class=\"code\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"code__bar\"><span class=\"code__file\">verify.py</span><button class=\"code__copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\"><span>复制</span></button></div><pre class=\"code-pre\"><code class=\"language-python\"><span class=\"n\">con</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">sqlite3</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">connect</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dst_path</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">ok</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">con</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">execute</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"PRAGMA integrity_check\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fetchone</span><span class=\"p\">()[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n<span class=\"k\">assert</span> <span class=\"n\">ok</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"ok\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">ok</span>\n<span class=\"n\">posts</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">con</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">execute</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"SELECT COUNT(*) FROM posts\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fetchone</span><span class=\"p\">()[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sa\">f</span><span class=\"s2\">\"完整性正常，文章 </span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"n\">posts</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\"> 篇\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span></code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"我现在的做法\">我现在的做法</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" checked=\"checked\" disabled=\"disabled\" type=\"checkbox\"> 用 <code>backup()</code> 做在线备份，不再 <code>cp</code></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" checked=\"checked\" disabled=\"disabled\" type=\"checkbox\"> 每次备份后立刻校验完整性</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" disabled=\"disabled\" type=\"checkbox\"> 每月做一次真正的“恢复演练”（下个月记得！）</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"gallery gallery--3\"><figure class=\"gallery__item\"><img src=\"/media/d3deb8e4526a77dcc429a90663224c72/960.webp\" alt=\"下雨的窗户\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/media/d3deb8e4526a77dcc429a90663224c72/480.webp 480w, /media/d3deb8e4526a77dcc429a90663224c72/960.webp 960w, /media/d3deb8e4526a77dcc429a90663224c72/1600.webp 1000w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 760px) 360px, 50vw\" width=\"960\" height=\"672\" data-full=\"/media/d3deb8e4526a77dcc429a90663224c72/1600.webp\" data-color=\"#e6f1fc\"></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><img src=\"/media/4dde97dfbebbc482f2f0aaed290490d4/960.webp\" alt=\"粉色的傍晚\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/media/4dde97dfbebbc482f2f0aaed290490d4/480.webp 480w, /media/4dde97dfbebbc482f2f0aaed290490d4/960.webp 960w, /media/4dde97dfbebbc482f2f0aaed290490d4/1600.webp 1200w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 760px) 360px, 50vw\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" data-full=\"/media/4dde97dfbebbc482f2f0aaed290490d4/1600.webp\" data-color=\"#fdeef3\"></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><img src=\"/media/e6ca34af7def8ec28205211939211af6/960.webp\" alt=\"远处淡蓝色的山\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/media/e6ca34af7def8ec28205211939211af6/480.webp 480w, /media/e6ca34af7def8ec28205211939211af6/960.webp 960w, /media/e6ca34af7def8ec28205211939211af6/1600.webp 1200w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 760px) 360px, 50vw\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" data-full=\"/media/e6ca34af7def8ec28205211939211af6/1600.webp\" data-color=\"#e6f1fc\"></figure></div>\n<div class=\"callout callout--love\"><p class=\"callout__title\">最后</p>\n<p>数据没丢，我也没哭。如果你也在用 SQLite，现在就去打开备份目录看一眼，真的。<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#fn1\" id=\"fnref1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[1]</a></sup></p>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"footnotes-sep\">\n<section class=\"footnotes\">\n<ol class=\"footnotes-list\">\n<li id=\"fn1\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>如果打开后发现备份不对，别慌，先别动原文件，从最近一份能通过校验的备份开始恢复。 <a href=\"#fnref1\" class=\"footnote-backref\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</section>\n",
